                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a super cute kart racer and a real labour of love from the developer. Supersonic Tank Cats just got better and better through early access with the developer adding loads of content to the game. It's very different to how it started out - the game has come a long way.\n\nThere is LOADS of content to keep you busy for a while - battle modes with local multiplayer, challenges and races.. plenty of different characters and powerups to try out. It's awesome.\n\nIt's colourful and fun but challenging in all the right places. Gameplay is awesome and it's solid technically, too. It supports controller perfectly and wide screen resolutions.\n\nIf you love racing games, kart racers or supersonic tank cats, get it. Just buy it now already, it's great and we should be 100% supporting developers like Molegato who are making games with real heart <3",
